==German==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈkʁøːtə/|lang=de}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{etyl|gmh|de}} {{term|krotte|lang=gmh}}, {{term|kröte|lang=gmh}}, {{term|krete|krëte|lang=gmh}}, from {{etyl|goh|de}} {{term|chrota|lang=goh}}, {{term|krota|lang=goh}}, {{term|kreta||toad|lang=goh}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{m|gem-pro|*krudō}}, {{m|gem-pro|*kredō||toad}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|de}} {{m|ine-pro|*guredʰ-||toad}}. Cognate with {{etyl|gml|-}} {{term|krode|krōde|toad|lang=gml}}.

====Noun====
{{de-noun|f||Kröten}}

# [[toad]]

====Derived terms====
* [[Schildkröte]]
* [[Krötenwanderung]]

====See also====
* [[Frosch]] {{g|m}}
* [[Kaulquappe]] {{g|f}}

===Etymology 2===
Probably a humorous [[malapropism]] of {{etyl|nds-de|de}} {{m|nds-de|Groten}}, from {{etyl|gml|de}} {{m|gml|grōten}}. Compare German {{m|de|Groschen}}.

